{"seq":22,"slug":"mathematical-optimization","title":"数学优化与运筹学","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization","rating":{"composite":3.54,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 数学优化与运筹学\n\n当一家电商要在双十一前决定每个仓库囤多少货、每辆卡车走哪条线、每个促销位投给谁，背后跑的不是直觉，而是一台把「目标、约束、决策变量」翻译成数学并求出最优解的引擎。数学优化与运筹学就是这台引擎的理论与工程。它回答一类共同的问题：在所有可行方案里，哪一个让某个量最大或最小。\n\n这个 hub 沿着一条从抽象到落地的主线展开，分四章递进。\n\n第一章「基础」打地基。任何优化任务都要先被写成一个标准的数学对象——决策变量、目标函数、约束集合——这是建模的起点。随后我们进入凸优化，因为凸性是区分「能可靠求到全局最优」与「只能碰运气找局部解」的分水岭。最后用对偶与 KKT 条件给出最优解的刻画，它既是理论的核心，也是几乎所有求解算法停机判据的来源。\n\n第二章「线性与整数规划」是运筹学最成熟、工业落地最广的部分。线性规划与单纯形给出多项式规模问题的精确解法；整数规划与分支定界处理「不可拆分」的离散决策，代价是计算复杂度的跃升；网络流则是一类有特殊结构、可以被极快求解的线性规划，是排班、运输、匹配问题的通用语言。\n\n第三章「非线性与元启发式」面向目标或约束不再是线性的世界。梯度法与牛顿法是连续可微优化的主力，也是现代机器学习训练的根基；约束优化处理带等式与不等式约束的非线性问题；当问题既不凸又不可导、甚至是黑箱时，元启发式用群体搜索与随机扰动给出工程上够用的解。\n\n第四章「工程实践」把前三章接到真实系统。建模语言与求解器讲清如何用 Pyomo、JuMP、AMPL 表达模型并交给 Gurobi、HiGHS、OR-Tools 求解；运筹应用串起调度、路径规划、库存等经典场景；大规模与近似面对百万级变量时的分解、列生成与 GPU 加速等前沿手段。\n\n四章之间不是并列而是递进：基础提供语言与判据，线性整数与非线性是两类问题的算法武器库，工程实践则是把武器交到生产环境手里。读完整个 hub，你应当能从一个模糊的业务问题出发，识别它属于哪一类优化问题、选对算法与工具、并在它变大时知道如何扩展。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"optimization-formulation","title":"优化问题的形式化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/foundations/optimization-formulation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"convex-optimization","title":"凸优化基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/foundations/convex-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"duality-kkt","title":"对偶与 KKT 条件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/foundations/duality-kkt"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"linear-integer","title":"线性与整数规划","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/linear-integer","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"linear-programming-simplex","title":"线性规划与单纯形","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/linear-integer/linear-programming-simplex"},{"seq":2,"slug":"integer-programming-bnb","title":"整数规划与分支定界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/linear-integer/integer-programming-bnb"},{"seq":3,"slug":"network-flows","title":"网络流问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/linear-integer/network-flows"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"nonlinear-metaheuristic","title":"非线性与元启发式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/nonlinear-metaheuristic","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gradient-newton-methods","title":"梯度法与牛顿法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/nonlinear-metaheuristic/gradient-newton-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"constrained-optimization","title":"约束优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/nonlinear-metaheuristic/constrained-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"metaheuristics","title":"元启发式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/nonlinear-metaheuristic/metaheuristics"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"modeling-solvers","title":"建模语言与求解器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/practice/modeling-solvers"},{"seq":2,"slug":"or-applications","title":"运筹应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/practice/or-applications"},{"seq":3,"slug":"large-scale-approximation","title":"大规模与近似","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mathematical-optimization/practice/large-scale-approximation"}]}]}